{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your underwater world with this premium DLC! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Round</strong> &amp; <strong>Jelly</strong> Add-on introduces beautifully <strong>curved aquariums</strong>, offering a fresh perspective and new creative possibilities beyond standard rectangular tanks. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This DLC also brings an entirely new creature type to your aquarium: <strong>jellyfish</strong>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656810/extras/Description_Jelly.gif?t=1744442817\" />Graceful, mysterious, and mesmerizing, jellyfish float and pulse with lifelike animations. You'll get <strong>6 unique jellyfish species</strong>, each with their own visual charm. Perfect for players who want to take their aquarium to the next level.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3656810?t=1744442817","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656810/8b64222675e4a1b534575624f469d1b7cc43a5ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744442817","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656810/818ad25406f6bd3a74ac9ecad15c2a35e889c09a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744442817","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3656810/818ad25406f6bd3a74ac9ecad15c2a35e889c09a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744442817","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your underwater world with this premium DLC! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Round</strong> &amp; <strong>Jelly</